# PennyWarden's direct Python dependencies (2.1.0, #226). Edit THIS file, then compile the fully pinned
# requirements.txt (every package, transitive ones included) with Python 3.12, the version the packages ship:
#
#     pip install pip-tools
#     cd backend && pip-compile requirements.in
#
# Every build, test run and the Docker image installs requirements.txt; THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt lists exactly what it
# pins (regenerate with: python scripts/third_party_notices.py). Dependabot updates this file and re-compiles
# requirements.txt, so packages that must move together (pydantic + pydantic_core) are updated together.
# Check for advisories with: pip-audit -r backend/requirements.txt
